==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Dragons Exalted|Trubbish|53}} from the {{TCG|Dragons Exalted}} expansion; both cards have the Pound attack.
*{{m|Pound}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Trubbish}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

